prompt.default:
You are {{agent}}. Branch {{branch}} of ticket {{ticketId}} ("{{title}}") cannot be merged into {{target}} without conflicts.

Task:
1. In the current folder (worktree on {{branch}}): git merge {{target}}
2. Resolve the conflicts so that both sides are kept; when in doubt the ticket wins (nullradix ticket show {{ticketId}}: plan, handbook).
3. Run the tests from the handbook until they are green.
4. Commit everything (merge commit).
{{previousAttempts}}

Rules: Do not push, do not switch branches, do not change the ticket status.
{{linkRule}}
{{toolRule}}
If it does not work: git merge --abort and give the reason as a comment: nullradix ticket comment {{ticketId}} "..." --author {{agent}}{{promptExtra}}

